"{\"new_string\":\"- Build the package and record the output artifact hash:\\n\\n  ```bash\\n  npm run build                      # produces dist/index.js and dist/index.js.sha256\\n  sha256sum -c dist/index.js.sha256  # verify the artifact\\n  ```\\n\\n  The build is a deterministic copy of `index.js` into `dist/`, so rebuilding from the same frozen inputs always yields a byte-identical artifact with the same SHA-256 hash.\\n\\n- Dependencies: none — the lockfile currently pins only the root package.\",\"old_string\":\"- Dependencies: none — the lockfile currently pins only the root package.\",\"path\":\"README.md\"}"